# RoamVantage — 360 viewer

## Package

- `@jeffgo10/panorama-viewer@0.2.0` (ls-foundry)
- App wrapper: `src/components/viewer/panorama-viewer.tsx` (`forwardRef` + `dynamic` + `ssr: false` + styles)
- `transpilePackages: ["@jeffgo10/panorama-viewer"]` in `next.config.ts`
- Import CSS via wrapper (`@jeffgo10/panorama-viewer/styles.css`) — do not re-add local Pannellum CDN

## Usage

- Props: `imageUrl`, `markers` (`PanoramaMarker`), `mode` (`view` | `edit`), `onSphereClick`, `onMarkerClick`, `onMarkerMove`, `fitParent`
- Gyro (view only): `orientationControl`, `orientationOnByDefault`, `onOrientationChange`; handle `startOrientation` / `stopOrientation`
- iOS: `deviceOrientationPermissionRequired()` → show “Enable motion” (top-right overlay, not over Pannellum zoom) and call `ref.startOrientation()` from a tap. Reset `orientationActive` on scene change — Pannellum remounts and does not emit `onOrientationChange(false)` on destroy.
- Marker kinds: `navigation` | `info` | `label`; content types: text / image / html / rich
- Pin visibility overrides: `src/components/viewer/panorama-hotspots.css` (size, contrast ring, ripple)
- Used by: `/tours/[id]/edit`, `/t/[slug]`, `/t/demo`

## Keep in RoamVantage

Scene URLs (R2), hotspot CRUD persistence, tour navigation between scenes, watermarks/tiers, public share UX.

Editor (`TourEditorClient`): **explicit Save** — local draft (blob previews until Save); new tours are not inserted until first Save (`/tours/new/edit`); rename / delete / reorder scenes; place + drag-move hotspots; Save creates tour if needed, uploads R2, reconciles DB; Publish saves first if dirty.

Public viewer: `orientationControl` on; keep off in edit mode.

### Public contact CTA (Free vs Phase 3)

- **Free (now):** one fixed button **Get in touch** → `mailto:` owner email via `TourPayload.contact_email` (RPC `contact_email_for_active_tour`). Hide the button when email is null.
- **Pro / Team (Phase 3 — not built yet):** editable primary CTA label + action; optional secondary CTA. Free stays fixed mailto. Likely tour-level fields: `cta_primary_label`, `cta_primary_href`, `cta_secondary_*`.

